<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine stock market closed for Easter holidays.</title>
<headline>Philippine stock market closed for Easter holidays.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Stock Exchange is closed on Friday for the Easter holidays. It will resume trading on Monday.</p>
<p>The composite index closed 19.02 points higher on Wednesday to close at 3,223.14 points. The stock exchange was also closed on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
